---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';

const lastUpdated = "December 18, 2025";
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Cookie Policy - Launch Big Brands ™"
  description="Learn about how Launch Big Brands uses cookies and tracking technologies to improve your experience on our ecommerce growth agency website."
>
  <Header showYellowStrip={false} />

  <main style="background:#fff;padding:60px 20px;">
    <style>
      .policy-page {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        color: #0f172a;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      .policy-page h1 {
        font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 44px);
        font-weight: 900;
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        color: #0f172a;
      }
      .policy-page .updated {
        color: #475569;
        font-size: 15px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }
      .policy-page h2 {
        font-size: 26px;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin: 40px 0 16px;
        color: #2563eb;
      }
      .policy-page h3 {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 28px 0 12px;
        color: #0f172a;
      }
      .policy-page p {
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        color: #475569;
        font-size: 16px;
      }
      .policy-page ul {
        margin: 0 0 20px;
        padding-left: 24px;
      }
      .policy-page li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        color: #475569;
      }
      .policy-page strong {
        color: #0f172a;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .policy-page a {
        color: #2563eb;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .policy-page a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
      .policy-page table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .policy-page th,
      .policy-page td {
        border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        padding: 12px;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .policy-page th {
        background: #f8fafc;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #0f172a;
      }
    </style>

    <div class="policy-page">
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated"><strong>Last Updated:</strong> {lastUpdated}</p>

      <p>
        At <strong>Launch Big Brands</strong>, we use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your experience, analyze website traffic, and deliver personalized content. This Cookie Policy explains what cookies are, how we use them, and your choices regarding cookies when you visit our ecommerce growth agency website.
      </p>

      <h2>1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
      <p>
        Cookies are small text files stored on your device (computer, tablet, or mobile phone) when you visit a website. They help websites remember your preferences, track your browsing behavior, and improve functionality.
      </p>
      <p>
        Cookies can be <strong>"first-party"</strong> (set by Launch Big Brands) or <strong>"third-party"</strong> (set by external services like Google Analytics or advertising platforms).
      </p>

      <h2>2. Why We Use Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Launch Big Brands uses cookies to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Improve User Experience:</strong> Remember your preferences and settings</li>
        <li><strong>Analyze Traffic:</strong> Understand how visitors interact with our website</li>
        <li><strong>Optimize Performance:</strong> Improve site speed and functionality</li>
        <li><strong>Marketing and Advertising:</strong> Deliver relevant ads and track campaign performance</li>
        <li><strong>Security:</strong> Protect against fraud and enhance website security</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Types of Cookies We Use</h2>

      <h3>Essential Cookies</h3>
      <p>
        These cookies are necessary for the website to function properly. They enable basic features like page navigation, secure login, and access to certain areas of the site. Without these cookies, our website cannot operate correctly.
      </p>
      <p><strong>Examples:</strong> Session cookies, security cookies</p>

      <h3>Analytics Cookies</h3>
      <p>
        These cookies help us understand how visitors interact with our website by collecting and reporting information anonymously. We use this data to improve our site and services.
      </p>
      <p><strong>Examples:</strong> Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager</p>

      <h3>Functionality Cookies</h3>
      <p>
        These cookies allow our website to remember choices you make (such as your language preference) and provide enhanced, personalized features.
      </p>
      <p><strong>Examples:</strong> Preference cookies, user session data</p>

      <h3>Marketing and Advertising Cookies</h3>
      <p>
        These cookies track your browsing activity to deliver relevant advertisements and measure the effectiveness of our marketing campaigns. They may be set by Launch Big Brands or third-party advertising partners.
      </p>
      <p><strong>Examples:</strong> Meta Pixel, Google Ads, retargeting pixels</p>

      <h2>4. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Launch Big Brands works with trusted third-party services that may place cookies on your device. These include:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> Tracks website usage and visitor behavior</li>
        <li><strong>Google Tag Manager:</strong> Manages tracking tags and scripts</li>
        <li><strong>Meta (Facebook) Pixel:</strong> Tracks conversions and enables retargeting</li>
        <li><strong>Calendly:</strong> Embedded booking widget for scheduling calls</li>
        <li><strong>Advertising Platforms:</strong> Google Ads, TikTok Ads, etc.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        These third parties have their own privacy policies governing how they collect and use data. We encourage you to review their policies:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Meta Privacy Policy</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://calendly.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Calendly Privacy Policy</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Cookie Duration</h2>
      <p>
        Cookies can be:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Session Cookies:</strong> Temporary cookies that expire when you close your browser</li>
        <li><strong>Persistent Cookies:</strong> Remain on your device for a set period (days, months, or years) until they expire or you delete them</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Managing Your Cookie Preferences</h2>
      
      <h3>Browser Settings</h3>
      <p>
        Most web browsers allow you to manage cookie preferences through their settings. You can:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Block all cookies</li>
        <li>Accept only first-party cookies</li>
        <li>Delete cookies after each session</li>
        <li>Receive a notification before a cookie is stored</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Note: Blocking or deleting cookies may affect your experience on Launch Big Brands' website and limit certain functionalities.
      </p>

      <h3>Browser-Specific Instructions</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Chrome</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/enhanced-tracking-protection-firefox-desktop" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mozilla Firefox</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://support.apple.com/guide/safari/manage-cookies-sfri11471/mac" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Safari</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/delete-cookies-in-microsoft-edge-63947406-40ac-c3b8-57b9-2a946a29ae09" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Microsoft Edge</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Opt-Out Tools</h3>
      <p>
        You can opt out of certain third-party tracking and advertising cookies:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-Out Browser Add-On</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/help/568137493302217" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Meta Ad Preferences</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Digital Advertising Alliance Opt-Out</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Do Not Track Signals</h2>
      <p>
        Some browsers offer a "Do Not Track" (DNT) feature that sends a signal to websites requesting not to track your activity. At this time, Launch Big Brands does not respond to DNT signals, as there is no industry-wide standard for how to handle them.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Updates to This Cookie Policy</h2>
      <p>
        Launch Big Brands may update this Cookie Policy from time to time to reflect changes in technology, legal requirements, or our practices. Updates will be posted on this page with a new "Last Updated" date.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about our use of cookies or this Cookie Policy, please reach out:
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Launch Big Brands</strong><br>
        Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@launchbigbrands.com">privacy@launchbigbrands.com</a><br>
        Website: <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a>
      </p>

      <p style="margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-size: 14px; color: #64748b;">
        By continuing to use Launch Big Brands' website, you consent to our use of cookies as described in this Cookie Policy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
